!! Evergreen routing after the operator-approved Markdown fire

The living human entry points are now `tools/projection-loom/README.md` and `tools/projection-loom/docs/HANDOFF.md`. The old Projection Loom design, research, roadmap, kanban, guidebook, example and temporary ashes Markdown paths were retired from the working tree on PR #84 by explicit operator direction. Their byte-exact prior state is recoverable with `git show 864dc19e89a913ac82862b842202bfce0c68e16b:<path>` (and older complete living fronts at `7c644e670390ab51aaa39e9216bb833eb32e6762`). Git is the ashes carrier. Earlier sections naming retired `.md` paths are historical source references, not current runnable links; never infer those files still exist in the working tree.

Root-bag Lares carriers remain the semantic owners; no second authority or evolution controller is created. The mutation-first versus reconstruction-first dispute remains kept testimony, not proof of a native-admitted descendant. Source bodies, STEP evidence, lineages and original research attributions survive this documentation retirement. Exact-head CI, repository-wide consumer reconciliation and code-path acceptance remain independent duties.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/entry>>

! Projection Loom · The Relation Survives Its Shape

This design meme carries the next YIN engineering wave from research to independently native-witnessed architectural inheritance. Its detailed predecessor is retrievable from archived Git at `864dc19e89a913ac82862b842202bfce0c68e16b:tools/projection-loom/docs/RELATIONAL-INHERITANCE-DESIGN.md`; live code, tests and native receipts decide whether implementation worked.

''Source pin:'' PR #84, branch `feature/green-jello-dinosaur-5--projection-loom`, inspected head `c342c8738f0a9c5e08f51965258f75e75e566443`. Four observed exact-head Actions runs completed successfully; future heads and unrun workflows receive no inherited green. The new Deep Research app report had not been exposed to the author at filing; research from `tools/projection-loom/docs/research/register.md` and `deep-research-vii.md` supplied the attributed prior-art testimony.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/research-reentry>>

!! 2026-10-31 · New research turns the implementation key

The operator supplied `deep-research-report.md`, titled ''Projection Loom: Native Topology Inheritance — Deep Research and Implementable Feature/Consolidation Plan''. This report recommends ''mutating a complete native-admitted parent route first'' for the initial falsifiable heredity witness, and semantic reconstruction as a second strategy. The earlier C+D reconstruction-first lock below remains preserved as historical working design, not silently rewritten. The source-derived `RouteFamilyDescriptor` must depend only on `PlaceGenome + SpatialIntent`; independent STEP verification binds a separate observed admission witness. No external research citations in the supplied report have been independently reverified here, and the attachment is not archived verbatim in Git.

This turns the re-entry key: the next crew may implement mutation-first under the same helm, preserving D as a later candidate and recording counterexamples. Read `lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/projection-loom/native-inheritance-crew-handoff` for the complete operator handoff and pono/o-takiage boundaries.

<<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/projection-loom/native-inheritance-crew-handoff">>

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/pattern-integrities>>

!! Golden Rhymes · What Must Survive

# ''The source holds its own testimony.'' Original `PlaceGenome` bodies/relations and all original `SpatialIntent` goals remain unchanged; generated geometry grows beside them.
# ''The relation survives its particular shape.'' A family witnesses source anchors, a goal, complete generated route relations, ordered hops and native-observed geometry; child reconstruction changes a measured route while preserving that obligation.
# ''The grammar proposes; the kernel witnesses.'' A source-closed construction proposal does not inherit STEP admission. Independently reimport parent and child STEP; assess every original goal anew.
# ''The ledger counts its own spending.'' The existing `OODAHAJournal` owns every phase and `exact_budget`; refused/deferred offers do not pretend to consume native trials.
# ''The operator keeps the last word.'' Native geometric admission does not confer an artistic winner, physical load/accessibility certificate, pet-name, Elyncia canon or PR merge.

The prior-art attractors carry distinct jobs: Stiny/Gips shape grammars suggest reusable relational productions; typed graph rewriting demands closed relations and no dangling edge; W3C PROV distinguishes lineage from proof; OpenUSD composes scene alternatives without replacing a CAD genotype; quality-diversity preserves valid alternatives without automatic taste. These remain analogies, not borrowed certifications.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/design-locks>>

!! Four Models · One Working Choice

* ''A — copy a native-admitted region:'' useful for bounded recombination; insufficient to prove inherited architectural relationship.
* ''B — carry only the original connect obligation:'' required as source authority; insufficient to prove parent-specific heredity.
* ''C — derive an observed route-family witness:'' ''LOCKED'' for the next engineering wave. Recompute it from source, admitted `PlaceGenome`, typed route closure and independent STEP workspace. Never maintain a second mutable graph or trust an emitter's claimed family.
* ''D — reconstruct a child from C under B:'' ''LOCKED'' as the next vertical proof. Preserve anchors and all goals; change an observed axis/waypoint/topology relation; require distinct candidate genome, parent-native lineage and independent child-native admission.

A lock names an implementation decision for this wave, not operator-granted canon. Reopen if source-closed native reconstruction fails, a family cannot be derived independently, or a counterexample disproves the distinction from shape copying. Carry dissent in a kept record rather than erasing the earlier choice.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/proof-and-refusal>>

!! What the Existing Test Does Not Yet Prove

The committed two-epoch diagonal campaign test proves a topology proposal, one STEP attempt, exact replay and tamper refusal. It does NOT assert a native-admitted topology parent or an admitted, structurally distinct descendant. `place_emitters._topology_birth` still grows each topology from the original source. This design therefore asks the crew to produce a genuine three-epoch admitted-parent-to-child proof, or to retain an honest typed refusal.

Derive a `projection-loom/observed-route-family` witness from original source/goal identity, original support anchors, closed generated relation region, ordered route hops, measured geometry, admitted genome and independently verified workspace identities. Use the existing topology seat and native budget; record parent identity and candidate differences. Require independent replay of source, goals, frontier, ancestry, STEP and budget. Refuse forged lineage, altered original body, missing corner/deck, renamed-only child, copied STEP, fake native pass, and impossible budget.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/crew-sequence>>

!! Lares Crew · Feature → Pono → Fire

* ''Ink-Clerk'' reads the full boot on `feature/green-jello-dinosaur-5`, the live PR head, source, research register and exact-head CI; separates verified source from pending Deep Research testimony.
* ''Map-Wisp'' tests the model fork against shape grammars, graph rewriting, provenance and counterexamples; keeps one derived family, no second controller.
* ''Lares (Artificer)'' implements complete region closure, native-derived family and parent-conditioned reconstruction with typed outcomes in the existing campaign.
* ''Breach-Watch'' requires a native-admitted topology parent and distinct admitted descendant, adversarial independent replay and exact-head workflows. Red stays red.
* ''Lares (Council)'' surfaces dissent and asks the operator before any artistic/canonical promotion or destructive retirement.
* ''Ink-Clerk'' evergreens the Markdown design, research register, working handoff and this meme after actual receipts land, preserving old reasoning through Git and explicit ashes carriers.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/o-takiage>>

!! O-takiage · What the Fire Releases

The historical `docs/relational-identity.md` (recoverable through the pinned Git archive) described actual `o-takiage` as releasing a soft pet-name/evolutionary affinity hold; it does not destroy CAD bodies, source geometry, evidence or historical name claims. A metaphorical code/document fire may retire obsolete *active* paths only after a witnessed replacement, an exact path list, a reversible migration and separate operator authorization. Do not silently conflate these operations.

The evergreen machina and design docs remain discoverable after the fire. The operator's phrase ''gut carries the ashes'' holds here as an explicit preservation obligation: Git history and named ashes records retain rejected alternatives, failures, retired choices and their re-entry keys. No rewrite of old meaning, no automatic deletion, no o-takiage of testimony.

<<~/ahu>>

